@startuml cardplay_only_state
title bridgeIQ — Card-Play-Only Flow (State machine)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FDFDFD
  BorderColor #444
  ArrowColor #444
}

[*] --> Idle : app launch / between deals

state Idle : a board exists (hands dealt), but auction is skipped

state ContractEntry <<choice>>
Idle --> ContractEntry : choose how to set the contract

ContractEntry --> SetContract : MiniBridge\n_maybe_run_minibridge_rounds()\nPoints dialog + Contract dialog\n(declarer resolved by HP)
ContractEntry --> SetContract : Repeat Deal — keep prior contract\n_on_repeat_deal() (skip auction)

state SetContract : controller.set_contract_direct(contract)
SetContract : • synthesize board.auction = [single Bid]
SetContract : • set declarer / dummy / opening_leader
SetContract : • phase='play', seat=opening_leader

SetContract --> Play

state Play {
  [*] --> OpeningLead
  OpeningLead --> InTrick : 1st card played\n_maybe_reveal_dummy_after_lead()
  InTrick --> InTrick : next card; seat=next\nCOMPUTER: request_card() -> _on_engine_card()\nHUMAN: table click -> _on_card_played()
  InTrick --> WaitingNext : trick complete (4 cards)\nphase='waiting_next'
  WaitingNext --> InTrick : "Next Card"\nadvance_to_next_trick(); phase='play'
}
note right of Play
  Identical play machine to the Whole Game flow
  (same _advance_play / play_card / no-peek engine).
  Only difference: there was no Bidding phase.
end note

Play --> Finished : 13 tricks played\n_review_human_signals(); phase='finished'

state Finished : _show_result() — score + end-of-hand view
Finished --> Idle : Next Deal / Repeat
Finished --> [*]  : quit
@enduml
